        "mds:value": "surface nitridation by N-plasma passivation and hydrazine-sulfide solution.",
        "mds:quote": "Among various plasma treatments, N-plasma passivation has gained the most extensive research and been considered a very effective way to get clean GaAs surface by terminating GaAs bonds with GaN [42–44]."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/AtomicLayerDeposition": {
